    "detailed_description": "Players control fish and eat glowing food to increase the number of fish and evolve into larger fish.<br />\r\nThe player aims for a high score by evolving fish and increasing the size of the fish population.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBe careful not to hit a swimming fish or other fish, as it will cause the game to end.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nConversely, if a swimming fish hits you, the fish will disappear and become food.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn addition to fish, there are other sea creatures that can attack the player, so be careful.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers enjoy the relaxing ocean space and try to make the fish as large and numerous as possible.<br />\r\nand how many fishes they can make.",
